)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Daily credits</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">50</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 class=\"text-response mb-3\">How access works</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ps-6 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"1\"><b><strong>Choose a duration and pay</strong></b> — 1 week, 1 month, 3 months, 6 months, or 12 months.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"2\"><b><strong>Get your access instantly</strong></b> — we send the Chrome extension access details via WhatsApp and email right after payment.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"3\"><b><strong>Start researching</strong></b> — open the extension in Chrome, select Ahrefs, and work in your own managed session.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Usage limits — read before buying</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"list-none ps-5 mb-3 [&amp;&gt;li]:relative [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-1 [&amp;&gt;li]:before:content-[&apos;&apos;] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:absolute [&amp;&gt;li]:before:-start-2 [&amp;&gt;li]:before:top-[0.65em] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:size-[3px] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:rounded-full [&amp;&gt;li]:before:bg-current\">\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"1\"><b><strong>50 credits per day.</strong></b> This service is built for regular research workflows — backlink checks, keyword research, competitor analysis — not bulk scraping.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"2\"><b><strong>One user per subscription.</strong></b> Sharing your access may result in suspension.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"3\"><b><strong>Desktop + Chrome required.</strong></b> The extension runs in the Chrome browser on a desktop or laptop; mobile is not supported.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"4\"><b><strong>No Rank Tracker, no API, no account settings.</strong></b> You get the research tools, not control of the underlying account.</li>\n<li class=\"text-response\" value=\"5\"><b><strong>Shared access, not an official seat.</strong></b> If you need guaranteed uptime, API access, or private client projects, buy Ahrefs directly instead.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Official Ahrefs vs. our shared access</h2>\n<table class=\"table-auto border-collapse border-none w-full my-3 [&amp;&gt;tr+tr]:border-t [&amp;&gt;tr+tr]:border-fill-divider\">\n<colgroup>\n<col />\n<col />\n<col /></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"last:border-b last:border-fill-divider\">\n<th class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)] bg-[var(--surface-quaternary)] text-start border-b-2 border-fill-divider border-t-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline-emphasized--font-weight)]\"></th>\n<th class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)] bg-[var(--surface-quaternary)] text-start border-b-2 border-fill-divider border-t-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline-emphasized--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Official Ahrefs subscription</p>\n</th>\n<th class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-