-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">≈ $18.33/month</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"last:border-b last:border-fill-divider\">\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">6 months</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">$100</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">≈ $16.67/month</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"last:border-b last:border-fill-divider\">\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">12 months</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">$180</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"border-0 px-4 py-2 align-top text-left break-words first:pl-0 relative [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-[length:var(--text-subheadline)] [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-[var(--text-subheadline--line-height)] [&amp;&gt;p]:font-[number:var(--text-subheadline--font-weight)]\">\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">$15.00/month</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Every plan includes the same 50 daily credits and the same feature access — duration is the only difference. Longer plans lower your average monthly cost.</p>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\"><b><strong>Need more than Ahrefs?</strong></b> See our Mega Plan for bundled access to additional SEO tools.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 data-block-id=\"1166f071-455c-4a35-90de-f8fbd2fc96c1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Who this is for</strong></h2>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\"><b><strong>Good fit:</strong></b> freelancers, bloggers, niche-site builders, and SEO learners who need solid Ahrefs data a few times a week — without paying $129/month for Ahrefs Lite ($1,548/year). Ahrefs also offers a limited Starter plan at $29/month.</p>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\"><b><strong>Buy Ahrefs directly instead if:</strong></b> you need API access, Rank Tracker, large daily crawls, or private client projects that must stay in your own account. That's the honest recommendation.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Real customer reviews</h2>\n<p>Don't take our word for it — here's what users say about our Ahrefs access on WhatsApp.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Refund / replacement policy</h2>\n<p>If your access doesn't work, you get a refund. Prefer to stay with us? We'll replace it with any other tool from our website instead — your choice. Message us on WhatsApp, 24/7.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">What exactly is an Ahrefs group buy?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">A cost-sharing setup: one provider manages premium Ahrefs accounts and gives many users controlled access through a managed system, splitting the subscription cost. You pay $20/month instead of buying an official plan.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Is the data the same as official Ahrefs?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Research results come from Ahrefs' own backlink and keyword datasets. What differs is availability: shared sessions, a 50-credit daily allowance, and no API, Rank Tracker, or account settings.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Is it safe to use?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">You never receive the underlying Ahrefs login credentials; access runs through our managed Chrome extension system. Avoid entering sensitive client credentials or confidential information into any shared-access environment. One honest caveat: account sharing conflicts with Ahrefs' terms, so we back every purchase with a refund-or-replacement guarantee if access is ever interrupted.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Which features are limited?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Rank Tracker and API access aren't included, and account settings stay with us. Exports count toward your 50 daily credits. Day-to-day research — backlink checks, keyword research, and competitor analysis — is available within the stated usage limits.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">How fast do I get access after paying?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Instant. You'll receive the extension access details on WhatsApp and email right after payment.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Does it work on mobile?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">No — access runs through a Chrome extension on desktop. Use a desktop or laptop.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">What happens if access stops working?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">Message us on WhatsApp (24/7). If we can't restore it, you choose: a refund, or a replacement with any other tool from our website.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Can I share my access with someone else?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">No — one user per subscription. Sharing may result in suspension.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-response mb-3\">Which subscription duration should I choose?</h3>\n<p class=\"text-response mb-3\">One week if you need Ahrefs for a short research project. One month for ongoing SEO work. The 3-, 6-, and 12-month plans bring the effective monthly price down to ≈ $18.33, ≈ $16.67, and $15.00 if you'll use the service continuously.</p>\n<p><!-- stgb-enriched-end --></p>\n",
